      <title>欢迎来到我的博客</title>
      <link href="/2026/08/02/hello-world/"/>
      <url>/2026/08/02/hello-world/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>欢迎来到我的博客!这是我用 <strong>Hexo</strong> 搭建的第一篇文章。</p><h2 id="关于这个博客"><a href="#关于这个博客" class="headerlink" title="关于这个博客"></a>关于这个博客</h2><p>本博客基于 <a href="https://hexo.io/">Hexo</a> 静态站点生成器和 <strong>Butterfly</strong> 主题搭建,支持:</p><ul><li>📁 <strong>分类和标签</strong> — 文章可按主题归档</li><li>🌙 <strong>暗色模式</strong> — 跟随系统或手动切换</li><li>🔍 <strong>本地搜索</strong> — 全站文章搜索</li><li>🚀 <strong>GitHub Pages 部署</strong></li></ul><h2 id="如何写新文章"><a href="#如何写新文章" class="headerlink" title="如何写新文章"></a>如何写新文章</h2><p>用下面的命令创建新文章:</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo new post <span class="string">&quot;文章标题&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>然后在 <code>source/_posts/</code> 下编辑生成的 Markdown 文件。文章开头可以添加 <code>categories</code> 和 <code>tags</code>:</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">---</span><br><span class="line">title: 文章标题</span><br><span class="line">date: 2026-08-02 15:31:00</span><br><span class="line">categories:</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">  -</span> 随笔</span><br><span class="line">tags:</span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">  - Hexo</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">---</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">这里是文章正文,使用 Markdown 语法书写。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="常用命令"><a href="#常用命令" class="headerlink" title="常用命令"></a>常用命令</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo clean      <span class="comment"># 清除缓存</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo generate   <span class="comment"># 生成静态文件(可用 hexo g)</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo server     <span class="comment"># 本地预览,访问 http://localhost:4000</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo deploy     <span class="comment"># 部署到 GitHub Pages(可用 hexo d)</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="结尾"><a href="#结尾" class="headerlink" title="结尾"></a>结尾</h2><p>祝阅读愉快!有问题随时查看 <a href="https://hexo.io/docs/">Hexo 文档</a> 或 <a href="https://butterfly.js.org/">Butterfly 文档</a>。</p>]]></content>
      
      
